{"4849630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vape Store Miami: Prologue", "steam_appid": 4849630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PROLOGUE NOTICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Store progression in the prologue is limited. The full game experience is available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/c70f680450ab4ddf46d07f65cddfedd9.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/38c365a7f6e9d9d4f51189a374d53273.poster.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/38c365a7f6e9d9d4f51189a374d53273.webm?t=1783616729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/38c365a7f6e9d9d4f51189a374d53273.mp4?t=1783616729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stock shelves, order products, serve customers, check out orders, answer calls, process online sales, ship packages, and keep your reputation strong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build the store your way in this vape shop simulator, and stay in control of every part of the business.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/4dce42d598a07da47a4c2cb401d7de87.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/3536dd691e18914e818a95fcf0abc1c0.poster.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/3536dd691e18914e818a95fcf0abc1c0.webm?t=1783616729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/3536dd691e18914e818a95fcf0abc1c0.mp4?t=1783616729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cut costs and boost profits by mixing your own e-liquids.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Order ingredients, apply recipes,  and sell your  products in-store.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/a4645a9b2a097d0f0c4b46f9eefac831.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/ff563657a37a1e81041c6bd019494efc.poster.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/ff563657a37a1e81041c6bd019494efc.webm?t=1783616729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/ff563657a37a1e81041c6bd019494efc.mp4?t=1783616729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Bring your vape shop vision to life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customize the floors, walls, ceilings, and store equipment to create a space that truly stands out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/6c8570166ff44e9e538c1f6ca2f24e14.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/474e5eb1edd44e733319ba411607a9a5.poster.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/474e5eb1edd44e733319ba411607a9a5.webm?t=1783616729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/474e5eb1edd44e733319ba411607a9a5.mp4?t=1783616729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play Vape Store Miami with friends in 1–4 player co-op.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Share tasks, split responsibilities, and keep the business running smoothly together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849630/extras/f7ddbb17da7626c72f94f1272b448979.avif?t=1783616729\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: cente